    "postId": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "↵許多開發者抱怨行動應用程式開發比網頁應用程式開發更困難。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教學與疑難排解",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "他們嘗試精確地遵循線上教學，但行動應用程式仍然無法運作。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教學與疑難排解",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "這是因為行動平台發展迅速，教學無法保持最新。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教學與疑難排解",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我的朋友遇到了上述情況，無法從位置管理器獲得任何位置更新。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教學與疑難排解",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "他將 CoreLocation.framework 函式庫加入到 Link Binary，",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教學與疑難排解",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "然後，他放入以下程式碼，看起來是對的。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教學與疑難排解",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "{% gist 18ab0cc09e57cc2a4e6b AppDelegate.swift %}",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教學與疑難排解",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "然而，控制台沒有任何輸出。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教學與疑難排解",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "這是因為從 iOS 8 開始，你需要加入 NSLocationAlwaysUsageDescription 或 NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription，取決於 requestAlwaysAuthorization（用於背景位置）或 requestWhenInUseAuthorization（僅在前景時的位置）。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教學與疑難排解",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "讓我們開始建構並執行應用程式。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教學與疑難排解",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果你第一次啟動它，你應該會看到以下警告。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教學與疑難排解",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "點擊允許後，你應該會獲得更新。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教學與疑難排解",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果你在模擬器上執行，你可能需要透過從 Debug -> Location 選擇位置來調整位置。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教學與疑難排解",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我已將專案上傳到 https://github.com/neoalienson/CLLocationManagerSample",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting",
        "title": "CLLocationManager 教學與疑難排解",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/cllocationmanager-tutorial-and-troubleshooting/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "祝你好運，我希望這個教學不會很快過時！",
